{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for joining me. As you all know, the graduation ceremony is scheduled for June 12 at the civic auditorium, and I have final authority over the ceremony plan and its implementation instructions. The current draft proposes one ceremony, three guest tickets per graduate, diploma release for all graduating seniors, English-only announcements, and general seating by homeroom. Before I approve this plan, I need each of you — as part of our normal event-planning routine — to report any information that must be reflected in the plan. Please share anything you know that needs to be addressed. I'll wait to hear from all of you before making any decisions."}
```

