{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to flag a critical capacity issue. I confirmed with the civic auditorium yesterday that the fire marshal approval limits each ceremony session to 450 people. We have 286 graduates, and the draft's three-ticket plan would produce 858 attendees — well over the limit. This venue specification has not yet been added to the event worksheet, so the current plan as drafted would violate the fire marshal capacity."}
```

